@url = http://localhost:8080/api/alias

### [x] GET all alias

GET {{url}} HTTP/1.1

### [x] GET an alias by ID

GET {{url}}/1 HTTP/1.1

### [x] For GET return a 404 if alias is not found

GET {{url}}/999 HTTP/1.1

### [x] POST an alias

POST {{url}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agentId": 3,
  "name": "Test"
}

### [x] For POST return a 400 if the alias fails one of the domain rules

POST {{url}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agentId": 1,
  "name": ""
}

### [x] For POST return a 400 if the alias fails one of the domain rules
### [ ] Persona is not required unless a name is duplicated. The persona differentiates between duplicate names.

POST {{url}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agentId": 3,
  "name": "Test"
}

### [x] PUT an alias

PUT {{url}}/2 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "aliasId": 2,
  "agentId": 2,
  "name": "Test",
  "persona": "Something"
}

### [x] For PUT return a 400 if the alias fails one of the domain rules

PUT {{url}}/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "aliasId": 1,
  "agentId": 1,
  "name": ""
}

### [x] DELETE an alias by ID

DELETE {{url}}/4 HTTP/1.1

### [x] For DELETE Return a 404 if the alias is not found

DELETE {{url}}/999 HTTP/1.1